1. Filter : $LOTLIST == 'UAM' OR $LOTLIST == 'PILOT' 
	判断是否为UAM系统call

2. Filter : componentQty>0 AND processingStatus=='Active' AND lotType!="CAR" AND lotType != 'CC' AND productName!='LotTemplate' AND materialType!='Durable' AND extraStatus=="WaitForJobPrep"
	筛选出可以正常做Job Prepare的Lots
	
3. Index add : FwLot -- sysId match with FwWipStep -- lotObject, and add processingState, stepRef, stepName, timeHereSince, handle, stageName, stepRevision, description, subPlanId columns;
	从FwWipStep获取step信息

4. Filter : processingState=="WaitingForUI" OR processingState=="WaitingForDispatch"
   筛选出可以正常做Job Prepare的Lots
   
5. Index add : FwEqpEquipment (name, sysId) -- eqpType match with FwEqpType -- sysId , and add eqpTypeName to main flow;
   根据Call RTD的机台ID信息获取当前机台的EQP type name
   
6. Filter : FULL(requiredCapability) OR (NULL(requiredCapability) AND resourceType==eqpTypeName OR resourceType==$Station)
    查看FwLot中lot当前需在哪种机台做process，看call RTD的机台是否满足条件

7. Index add : FwWipStep -- stepRef match with FwStep_N2M -- fromId, and add toId which meet (linkName=="versions" AND keyData=="stepRevision")
    根据step信息获取toId

8. Index add : FwStep_N2M -- fromId match with FabStepVersionExt -- parent, and add stepType
	获取当前step type

9. Filter : stepType!="Sorter" AND stepType!="ScheduledSorter" AND stepType!="UnScheduledSorter"
	对于非sort机台，过滤掉sorter类型的step
	
10. Index add : FwEqpEquipment -- sysId match with FabEqpCapability -- parent, and add capabilityName which is isEngEnabled=="T" AND isPtEnabled=="T"
	获取当前机台的可用状态，开关是否打开，并获取此机台的capability
	
11. Index add : FwLot -- requiredCapability match with FabEqpCapability -- capabilityName
	查看lot所需机台的能力是否与call RTD的机台能力匹配
	
12. Filter :  (FULL(requiredCapability) AND capabilityName==requiredCapability) OR 
			 (NULL(requiredCapability) AND ((resourceKind=="E" AND resourceType==$Station) OR (resourceKind=="T" AND resourceType==eqpTypeName)))
	只有lot所需机台的能力与call RTD的机台能力匹配时，才可用继续JP
	
13. MES reason : IF FULL(assignSpecificEqp) AND assignSpecificEqp!=$Station THEN "assignedEqp" ELSE ""
	如果Fwlot中有assignSpecificEqp安排其run在特定EQPID上，但当前EQP不是此assignSpecificEqp，则添加MES reason
	
14. RTD reason : IF physicalStatus!="InStocker" AND physicalStatus!="InTransit" THEN rtdReasons+"xPhyStatus|" ELSE rtdReasons
    如果LOT所在Foup不在AMHS(InStocker or InTransit)，则卡住不JP
	
15. Index add : FwLot -- transportId match with FabLotCarrierExt -- Lot->appId, and add state column. 

16. RTD reason :IF FULL(transportId) AND FabLotCarrierExt--state!="Reserved" THEN rtdReasons  ELSE rtdReasons+"xCarrier|"
	如果LOT的carrier(FOUP)状态是Reserved，则卡住不JP
	
17. RTD reason : Group by transportId, get current FwLot -- lotId -- extraStatus, IF LotExt->extraStatus is 'WaitForJobIn' or 'WaitForJobOut', then +'xMultiJob|'
    means one of lot in this FOUP already running or JP.
	
18. Index add : FabEqpPortEvent -- eqpPortId match with FwEqpEquipment -- name,  add portState, portMode, portType, 
	and filter portMode=='Auto' AND portState!="PORT_DOWN" AND !(portIsNtbLoadPort=='F' AND portBmovNtbEnable=='T' AND FULL(portBmovNtbLP))
	获取当前EQP的port状态，需满足auto条件

19. Join : FabEqpPortEvent -- eventName is READYTOUNLOAD or UNLOADCOMPLETE and in EvenTime < 10mins
	为了减少cycle time，将10分钟内JO，但还没有传到OHT上的lots也加入到可派工list
	
20. Index add : FwLot -- physicalLocation match with TAs' File -- srcLoc, get cross_load_JP grade
	TA文件中有计算source位置到target位置的距离并打分,如果cross_load_JP为999则认为source到target路径不通，需要xOHT

21. QTime Component : Global Check Qtime Urgency -- From FabInQTimeProcess get LotId, qTime Name, time Limit, Start Time Stamp. and get RCT, RQT, remSteps, remPT from WipQtimer table
	Get Lot's RQT and whether in QTime loop. Can add factor for dirrerent product to adjust the Qtime limit level.
	
22. PJP Component : For Pre Job Prepare Function, Get PJP type and pre Transfer score;

23. Get Location Score by Lot current location and destination EQP

24. Get CR : CR = (ForecastDate - PlanOutDate) / (ForecastDate - $Now)

25. Get Season Lot : From FabAutoSeasonJob -- isSeaonLot, status, lotId, eqpId, eqpType. if is season lot, then x inseason, can't JP.

26. Add RTD reason: I. if trackingUnit is 'Carrier' & allowMultiLotFlag is 'F' & multi lot in 1 foup, then need to add 'xAllowMultiLot|'
	   else if trackingUnit is 'Carrier' & allowMultiLotFlag is 'T' & lotcount_total not equal to lotcount_list, then need to add 'Wait4MultiLot|' (need wait all lots arrived)
